        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F-Series, Accent Door Lever Set With Traditional Addison Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSchlage's Accent Lever with the square Addison Rose is a beautiful example of traditional design. This leverset is a great way to add classic elegance to any home. It fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". It is adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" door thicknesses. Available in many finishes in single dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen you install Schlage lever, you safeguard your home and family as well as your peace of mind. Schlage door levers are resistant to tarnishing, discoloration and corrosion. Plus, the wide variety of finishes may make your decision tough--just like this lever.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Accent Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One piece lever for better security and appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2 series 4000 grade 2 keyed entry function.</li>\r\n<li>Pressure-cast zinc tubular lock housing.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime mechanical warranty on residential applications.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the F-Series Schlage Accent Door Lever Addison Collection:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height:  4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width:  2-27/32\" (2.84\")</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate: 1\" x 2-1/4\" Round Corner (1/4\" radius corners)</li>\r\n<li>Housing Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Throw: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate: 1-5/8\" x 2-1/4\" Round Corner Full Lip Strike Plate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button in the center of the lever while turning the inside lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small circular tool.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a handle operated by a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside when locked by inside turn button.  Inside always unlocked. </li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li>\r\nThe <b>Single Dummy Levers are Handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other Accent Lever functions are Non-Handed.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Accent Lever With Addison Rose, Schlage F-ACC-ADD",
                "description": "Schlage F Series Accent Door Lever - Schlage's Accent Lever with the square Addison Rose is a beautiful example of traditional design. This leverset is a great way to add classic elegance to any home. It fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is adjustable for 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches door thicknesses. Available in 8 finishes in single dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions.",
                "keywords": "SCH-accent-Levers, Schlage f series accent door levers, F170acc, dummy levers, F10acc, passage levers, f40acc, privacy lever sets, f51acc, keyed entry lever locksets, schlage  f-series door levers, Schlage door hardware accent Levers, accent schlage levers, scroll door levers, SCH-F-ACC-ADD, Schlage Addison collections, schlage Addison rose, schlage F ACC ADD, Traditional door leveres,"
